    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "School Shop",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nCreate a site map for a web app used by students to buy, sell, or trade books and school supplies.\r\n\r\nYour site map must include:\r\n- A home page\r\n- At least 3 main sections (for example: Buy, Sell, Messages)\r\n- At least 2 levels of hierarchy (for example: Home → Available Items → Item Details)\r\n\r\n**Save your site map to your Backpack.**",
